WEBVTT

00:04:59.293 --> 00:05:02.652
we tested the effects of a peer
insulting a group member.

00:05:03.442 --> 00:05:05.825
Now, what we found was really interesting,

00:05:05.849 --> 00:05:08.517
because witnesses'
performance decreased, too --

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:12.311
and not just marginally,
quite significantly.

00:05:14.159 --> 00:05:16.025
Incivility is a bug.

00:05:16.576 --> 00:05:18.197
It's contagious,

00:05:18.221 --> 00:05:22.062
and we become carriers of it
just by being around it.

00:05:22.525 --> 00:05:25.112
And this isn't confined to the workplace.

00:05:25.136 --> 00:05:27.657
We can catch this virus anywhere --

00:05:27.681 --> 00:05:32.133
at home, online, in schools
and in our communities.